# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Datasets and run artifacts
#
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose. A bare `data/` also matches the
# src/data/ package and silently unpublished it in an earlier project; verify
# with `git ls-files` after any change to this file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/data/
/outputs/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.npz
*.npy
*.h5
*.onnx

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and credentials
#
# The project currently contains none of these. They are listed so that a
# future token paste cannot reach a public repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
id_rsa*
credentials.json
service-account*.json
secrets*.yaml
secrets*.yml
.netrc
.npmrc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unpublished working documents
#
# GapAnalysis.md carries the pre-registration, the referee audit log, and the
# claim scoping that the manuscript has not yet earned. It is written by the
# authors as a private working note and stays out of version control.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
GapAnalysis.md

# Manuscript drafts. The .tex sources are tracked once a submission exists;
# until then the drafts and their build products stay local.
/paper/
/paper-*/
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.bcf
paper/*.blg
paper/*.out
paper/*.toc
paper/*.run.xml
paper/*.synctex.gz
paper/*.fdb_latexmk
paper/*.fls
paper/*.synctex
*.synctex.gz

